OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSALittle-Pengelly criticises O'Neill
OL,4,Aas nationalist first ministers to meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FLittle-Pengelly criticised O'Neill for
OL,7,Fattending Monday's talks, saying "she
OL,8,Fhas not sought any agreement or
OL,9,Fpermission from me to travel, attend or
OL,10,Fsign anything as first minister. She
OL,11,Fwould have needed to do so to do
OL,12,Fanything as FM".
OL,14,FSinn Fein's John O'Dowd said O'Neill
OL,15,Fwas attending in her role as party
OL,16,Fdeputy leader adding it was "right and
OL,17,Fproper" that parties in favour of
OL,18,Fgreater self determination "work with
OL,19,Feach other to achieve that goal".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
